WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:04.770
<i>Tonari's battle against 
the Nokkers continues.</i>

00:04.770 --> 00:05.700
Fushi!

00:05.700 --> 00:07.190
Do something! Please!

00:07.190 --> 00:08.670
Fushi!

00:10.290 --> 00:15.630
<i>In the moment of certain doom, 
Fushi's friends come to her aid.</i>

00:19.870 --> 00:21.300
I made it.

00:21.860 --> 00:27.880
<i>Meanwhile, Yuki's team rescues 
Mizuha from the underground.</i>

02:00.010 --> 02:04.010
Clean Water

02:04.970 --> 02:07.650
I can trust you, right?

02:07.650 --> 02:09.680
All of you?

02:20.610 --> 02:22.440
Could you please drink this?

02:23.440 --> 02:26.700
This is a pact ritual that's been 
passed down by the Guardians.

02:26.700 --> 02:31.740
Those who become one of us, of our 
friends, of our family, all drink this.

02:31.740 --> 02:35.800
It proves that we will always trust each 
other and would never betray one another.

02:38.490 --> 02:39.780
Don't worry.

02:39.780 --> 02:41.300
It's just water.

02:42.790 --> 02:44.710
And if we drink it...

02:45.530 --> 02:47.930
you'll come with us?

02:48.430 --> 02:49.480
Yeah.

02:50.280 --> 02:52.450
Are we sure about this water?

02:56.460 --> 02:57.890
You can do it, right?

03:05.450 --> 03:06.880
Don't do it!

03:18.620 --> 03:20.310
Okay, let's go.

03:21.600 --> 03:25.120
All you guys over there are 
coming to my place, too.

03:25.120 --> 03:27.630
Bon-san, could you contact Gramps

03:27.630 --> 03:30.220
and let him know I'm bringing 
a ton of people over?

03:30.220 --> 03:32.010
My phone's busted.

03:33.810 --> 03:35.360
Wait.

03:35.980 --> 03:38.140
You're interesting, Yuki-kun.

03:38.140 --> 03:40.290
You get hurt a lot, don't you?

03:40.290 --> 03:43.340
You seem like the type to 
not think things through.

03:43.340 --> 03:45.340
What if it's a trap?

03:45.340 --> 03:47.750
If the water is poisoned?

03:47.970 --> 03:51.450
Mr. Yuki sure is a man of reckless courage.

03:51.450 --> 03:53.350
You aren't one to talk, are you?

03:53.350 --> 03:55.010
So, is it poisoned?

03:55.280 --> 03:57.230
Of course not.

03:57.230 --> 03:59.490
He's my dear underclassman at school.

03:59.490 --> 04:01.580
It really is just water.

04:02.630 --> 04:06.760
When I asked if you and I, human and mutant,

04:06.760 --> 04:09.070
could be friends, you said yes.

04:09.070 --> 04:12.270
Did we say that?

04:14.890 --> 04:19.570
I believe what people say, 
no matter what they are.

04:19.570 --> 04:21.960
No matter <i>what</i> I am?

04:21.960 --> 04:23.830
I'm Mizuha.

04:23.830 --> 04:26.400
It's all back to normal!

04:26.400 --> 04:30.070
The Nokkers are gone, 
and the water was safe to drink!

04:30.460 --> 04:32.760
The Nokker's still here.

04:32.760 --> 04:35.540
And I've been talking to it this whole time.

04:36.770 --> 04:39.020
Oh? So you mean...

04:39.020 --> 04:43.010
it's still lurking in our midst?

04:43.010 --> 04:46.480
So, what's your name?

04:46.820 --> 04:51.670
Huh? I-I told you, I'm Mizuha.

04:54.410 --> 04:57.510
Mizuha-senpai is right-handed.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.660
It's gone.

05:19.170 --> 05:20.500
Aoki-kun!

05:20.500 --> 05:21.630
Vice President!

05:22.200 --> 05:23.910
Get a grip!

05:23.910 --> 05:25.580
Let's go see Satoru.

05:26.340 --> 05:28.850
Don't worry about me.

05:29.420 --> 05:33.380
We gotta go shopping for everyone's dinner.

05:33.380 --> 05:38.950
Fushi will bring Mizuha-senpai's 
Nokker to us.

05:38.950 --> 05:42.030
And we can talk it over,

05:42.030 --> 05:46.290
and they'll return Mizuha-senpai's 
body along with all the others.

05:46.780 --> 05:49.270
We can come to an understanding.

05:49.270 --> 05:50.920
I have faith that we can.

05:51.210 --> 05:53.540
Sheesh, you...

05:53.540 --> 05:55.340
How happy-go-lucky can you be?

05:56.030 --> 05:59.370
I wonder how Mizuha-kun would 
have reacted if she were here.

05:59.660 --> 06:03.840
I'd be happy just to see her 
cringing at me like always.

06:28.220 --> 06:30.700
Are you all right, Fushi-sama?

06:30.700 --> 06:34.100
Sorry, Chamihiko-san, 
but could you take care of Grandpa?

06:34.100 --> 06:36.200
Sure, but why...

06:36.200 --> 06:37.180
It's coming.

06:38.920 --> 06:40.620
Fushi-sama!

06:48.330 --> 06:50.300
Hey, Fushi.

06:51.040 --> 06:53.350
Hey. What's up?

06:53.350 --> 06:58.520
I've always wanted to fight 
you properly sometime.

06:58.520 --> 07:01.190
Which of us is stronger?

07:05.010 --> 07:08.190
I'm pretty sure you'll 
end up back in Paradise.

07:26.170 --> 07:29.370
Are you giving up on your ambitions?

07:37.290 --> 07:41.410
I'll reconsider if you defeat me.

07:55.980 --> 07:58.380
Is this supposed to stop me?

07:58.380 --> 07:59.410
You're too slow!

08:22.090 --> 08:23.260
Why?

08:23.260 --> 08:25.920
Why? Why? Why?

08:25.920 --> 08:27.730
Why? Why?

08:27.730 --> 08:29.150
Why?!

08:40.380 --> 08:42.610
Why are you going easy on me?

08:42.610 --> 08:46.420
Don't you see that I'm taking this seriously?

08:52.730 --> 08:56.350
Were you influenced by that 
friend of yours, Yuki?

08:56.350 --> 08:58.760
I like that boy.

09:02.550 --> 09:06.470
He didn't hesitate to drink 
the water with Nokkers in it.

09:06.470 --> 09:08.560
As a sign of friendship.

09:09.090 --> 09:10.520
Yuki did?!

09:14.270 --> 09:17.620
Don't tell me this is all you've got!

09:34.090 --> 09:36.770
This ought to be enough space.

09:37.750 --> 09:40.440
Go on and take your weapon.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.500
Your bow.

09:42.500 --> 09:43.680
Your sword.

09:43.680 --> 09:44.730
You're right.

09:44.730 --> 09:46.710
Yuki rubbed off on me.

09:47.130 --> 09:50.130
I don't want to kill you.

09:50.130 --> 09:54.640
I'm hoping that we can come to understand 
each other while we're both alive.

10:05.660 --> 10:06.700
Hey.

10:14.180 --> 10:17.140
It isn't over yet, Fushi.

10:27.820 --> 10:29.820
You moved your core.

10:29.820 --> 10:33.240
Do you think you can defeat me in that body?

10:33.240 --> 10:35.890
Are you really willing to do this?

10:35.890 --> 10:37.090
What about you?

10:37.090 --> 10:40.770
Aren't you cold in that 
clothing made of skin?

10:53.090 --> 10:55.710
Shall we continue, Fushi?

10:56.210 --> 11:00.340
Do you want to find out how 
meaningless your platitudes are?

11:00.340 --> 11:02.970
Do you really want to go on?

11:02.970 --> 11:08.410
You think my offer to debate you 
instead of killing you is a platitude?

11:08.410 --> 11:11.180
What do you expect? It's only human.

11:11.180 --> 11:14.820
But neither of us is human.

11:16.770 --> 11:19.610
God damn it, Chami.

11:19.610 --> 11:22.480
There's still more ammo in the storage.

11:22.820 --> 11:23.840
Heya.

11:23.840 --> 11:25.950
Want some help, Mizuha?

11:25.950 --> 11:28.160
No, Daddy.

11:28.160 --> 11:30.410
He isn't using his true strength yet.

11:30.410 --> 11:32.900
Cut him some slack.

11:32.900 --> 11:37.600
We've already taken the best 
of the Great Fushi's vessels.

11:37.600 --> 11:40.290
He's only got the feeble ones left.

11:40.290 --> 11:42.880
Oh, wanna use this, Fushi-sama?

11:43.720 --> 11:45.340
No, thanks.

11:45.340 --> 11:48.170
Entertain her properly, then, would you?

11:48.170 --> 11:50.850
You still have some that 
you can use, don't you?

11:52.590 --> 11:54.930
You've been hiding some?

11:57.100 --> 11:58.360
Show them!

12:05.800 --> 12:07.570
I wasn't hiding any.

12:07.990 --> 12:10.680
I was just waiting for the 
right reason to face you.

12:11.320 --> 12:13.490
The sixth descendant...

12:13.950 --> 12:15.670
Kahaku!

12:16.200 --> 12:21.270
The failure of a vessel!

12:27.660 --> 12:29.940
Don't insult my friends.

12:29.940 --> 12:31.980
Come get some more!

12:31.980 --> 12:33.090
Let me set you straight.

12:33.090 --> 12:34.600
Draw your weapon, Fushi!

12:36.370 --> 12:38.350
What's making you strong...

12:43.240 --> 12:46.200
is the blood of your ancestors 
coursing through your body.

12:51.970 --> 12:53.400
It hurts!

12:55.240 --> 12:57.800
It seems you aren't accustomed to pain yet.

12:58.140 --> 13:01.780
I doubt you're ready for death, 
judging from your reaction.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.720
Are you mental?

13:16.720 --> 13:18.140
What are you trying to accomplish?

13:19.000 --> 13:20.890
If you need a place to go,

13:21.590 --> 13:24.300
I'll be your vessel.

13:26.080 --> 13:28.270
Are you sure?

13:28.270 --> 13:31.620
I'd take all your vessels from you.

13:31.910 --> 13:37.060
I don't know how well I can keep 
the contaminant that is you at bay.

13:37.060 --> 13:41.650
But if it turns out that 
you're stronger, well...

13:41.650 --> 13:43.270
I'll cross that bridge when I get to it.

13:43.270 --> 13:45.420
You don't have a plan?!

13:58.140 --> 14:00.650
Wh-Why?!

14:00.970 --> 14:02.310
Relax.

14:02.310 --> 14:04.920
I let the main body evaporate.

14:04.920 --> 14:06.480
No, I mean....

14:07.060 --> 14:10.270
I figured it's time we head home, too.

14:10.650 --> 14:14.110
Try as we might to kill you, 
we couldn't find your core.

14:14.110 --> 14:17.370
And we were no match for your birth parent.

14:17.370 --> 14:20.710
Our battle in the current age is over.

14:20.710 --> 14:22.260
In the <i>current</i> age?

14:22.650 --> 14:24.560
We aren't done yet.

14:24.560 --> 14:26.960
We're in the middle of living, too.

14:27.230 --> 14:29.930
That one came here to be killed.

14:30.460 --> 14:31.920
To start over.

14:33.020 --> 14:35.760
The water here is contaminated with Nokkers.

14:35.760 --> 14:37.600
Wash them away.

14:37.600 --> 14:41.440
Take them to the sea, and they'll decide 
for themselves whether to live or die.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.030
Don't get the wrong idea.

14:49.030 --> 14:51.650
You haven't won.

14:52.160 --> 14:55.410
You're lucky I'm here, huh, Fushi?

14:58.350 --> 14:59.500
Later.

15:04.670 --> 15:08.170
Hey, Fushi!

15:08.170 --> 15:10.200
You around?

15:10.200 --> 15:12.090
Where are you?

15:12.090 --> 15:14.640
Are you all right?

15:14.890 --> 15:17.060
See? It's a total maze down here.

15:17.060 --> 15:19.860
I can't believe Fushi-san's 
group found their way.

15:19.860 --> 15:21.060
Indeed.

15:21.060 --> 15:22.310
Say, what about us?

15:22.310 --> 15:24.530
Where are we right now?

15:32.980 --> 15:34.030
Water.

15:37.950 --> 15:40.970
Don't tell me you're lost, Prince.

15:40.970 --> 15:41.850
Eh?

15:41.850 --> 15:45.140
I thought you two were leading the way.

15:45.140 --> 15:46.700
We weren't.

15:46.700 --> 15:49.640
Didn't we tell you that 
we don't remember the way?

15:49.640 --> 15:52.480
Yipes! What if we're trapped?!

15:52.480 --> 15:54.180
I didn't bring food or water!

15:54.480 --> 15:56.000
Stay calm, please.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.860
We'll bring some.

15:57.860 --> 15:59.460
Really? Thankies!

15:59.460 --> 16:01.060
Wait, no!

16:01.060 --> 16:03.230
Y'all are ghosts!

16:12.280 --> 16:14.060
That solves that problem, Prince!

16:14.060 --> 16:14.940
You have water!

16:14.940 --> 16:16.470
This is too much!

16:19.350 --> 16:20.870
Nice, it's the exit.

16:20.870 --> 16:22.870
This is the entrance!

16:27.890 --> 16:29.700
We were looking for Fushi!

16:29.700 --> 16:31.390
We're all the way back outside!

16:32.510 --> 16:33.640
Bon.

16:35.240 --> 16:36.500
Fushi!

16:36.500 --> 16:38.350
Thank goodness you're safe!

16:39.370 --> 16:41.990
Well? Did you settle things?

16:41.990 --> 16:43.400
Settle things?

16:45.070 --> 16:46.300
No.

16:47.320 --> 16:50.790
It didn't work out.

16:51.560 --> 16:55.530
We couldn't start anything over.

17:06.030 --> 17:08.720
Spares that you kept for insurance?

17:08.720 --> 17:09.830
Yeah.

17:09.830 --> 17:11.120
I never used them.

17:11.120 --> 17:13.940
That's absolutely fantastic.

17:13.940 --> 17:17.190
Now, we should head back to school.

17:17.190 --> 17:18.170
School?

17:19.100 --> 17:21.630
Bon, I'm going to head there first.

17:26.190 --> 17:27.610
Fu-chan!

17:28.120 --> 17:29.150
Fushi-kun.

17:29.150 --> 17:30.670
Guys!

17:30.670 --> 17:33.170
H-Hey... um...

17:33.610 --> 17:37.960
Just as you wanted, 
I captured the Nokkers alive.

17:38.370 --> 17:42.110
I'll send them out to sea later 
and let them decide where to go.

17:43.390 --> 17:44.910
What about Tonari?

17:44.910 --> 17:46.170
Tonari's dead.

17:46.170 --> 17:47.780
I killed her good.

17:47.780 --> 17:48.620
What?!

17:51.570 --> 17:53.790
Look at your face!

17:53.790 --> 17:56.850
Don't freak out just because I'm dead.

17:56.850 --> 17:58.670
T-T...

18:00.170 --> 18:01.680
T-Tonari!

18:01.680 --> 18:03.780
Shocked, huh?

18:03.780 --> 18:07.150
That kid, Satoru, was it? 
He brought me back to life.

18:07.150 --> 18:09.730
What's up with him? 
Do you know him, Fushi?

18:09.960 --> 18:12.940
I'm sorry. It must have hurt.

18:12.940 --> 18:14.980
This is my fault.

18:14.980 --> 18:18.890
Stupid! Don't apologize for that!

18:18.890 --> 18:20.610
Never mind that.

18:21.320 --> 18:23.390
You should have told us!

18:23.390 --> 18:27.410
We've been friends for centuries, you know?

18:27.410 --> 18:29.040
You ought to rely on us.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.430
No kidding.

18:30.430 --> 18:32.150
You're getting an earful later.

18:54.750 --> 18:56.190
Tanasen!

18:58.860 --> 18:59.970
Huh?

18:59.970 --> 19:02.320
Thank goodness she isn't dead!

19:05.290 --> 19:06.820
What is this?!

19:06.820 --> 19:08.930
What happened here?!

19:08.930 --> 19:10.700
We did it.

19:10.700 --> 19:11.800
Tee-hee.

19:11.800 --> 19:14.400
We were fighting off a baddie.

19:20.250 --> 19:21.450
Odd...

19:21.450 --> 19:23.470
Not a single soul in sight.

19:23.470 --> 19:25.740
No one's coming home.

19:25.740 --> 19:27.670
What's going on?

19:30.210 --> 19:32.290
The bear's gone, too.

19:32.290 --> 19:34.990
I never would have thought 
the day would come.

19:34.990 --> 19:38.570
How many cups of rice am 
I supposed to cook tonight?

19:43.200 --> 19:44.680
Gramps!

19:44.680 --> 19:46.210
I'm home!

19:46.210 --> 19:47.290
Yuki.

19:49.090 --> 19:51.410
I brought a ton of guests over.

19:51.410 --> 19:53.560
Make, like, a hundred cups of rice!

19:53.560 --> 19:56.250
Wh-Who's that behind you?

19:56.250 --> 19:59.210
Didn't Bon-san message you?

20:01.370 --> 20:03.420
Grandpa! Onii-chan!

20:03.420 --> 20:04.840
Aiko!

20:04.840 --> 20:07.260
I'm so glad you're safe.

20:11.180 --> 20:13.630
What's wrong? What happened?

20:14.260 --> 20:15.830
I'll explain.

20:16.250 --> 20:19.370
But first, let's have dinner.

20:23.990 --> 20:26.870
And then there was this flame, like, bam!

20:26.870 --> 20:29.860
You wouldn't believe how bad it was.

20:30.250 --> 20:32.330
It was insane.

20:32.330 --> 20:35.950
Man, I'm impressed you kids 
pulled that off on your own.

20:35.950 --> 20:37.950
Only because Tonari-san was there.

20:38.340 --> 20:41.350
Nah, it was mostly Aiko.

20:41.350 --> 20:44.090
Her ideas and quick thinking saved us.

20:44.380 --> 20:46.600
No, it wasn't that big a deal.

20:46.600 --> 20:50.030
I couldn't have done anything 
without the rest of you.

20:50.390 --> 20:52.020
Here, Satoru-kun.

20:52.920 --> 20:56.600
So he's the Black One that 
Fushi-san was talking about?

20:57.080 --> 20:58.030
Yup.

20:58.480 --> 21:00.870
It's hard to believe...

21:00.870 --> 21:04.950
but after seeing him capture the Nokkers...

21:05.920 --> 21:08.450
Salt works on the Nokkers?!

21:08.450 --> 21:09.320
Yes.

21:09.320 --> 21:12.070
We've confirmed that holy salt is effective.

21:12.070 --> 21:14.270
Although it only really 
slowed it down a little.

21:14.270 --> 21:16.930
See? I knew we should have used it!

21:16.930 --> 21:19.450
My bad. We'll do that next time.

21:19.450 --> 21:22.340
Next time?! No way, no more!

21:22.340 --> 21:24.470
But we were so badass.

21:22.620 --> 21:24.920
I kinda like this.

21:24.470 --> 21:26.740
I don't care!

21:24.920 --> 21:27.260
It's like real teamwork.

21:27.930 --> 21:31.100
Huh? Did I say something weird?

21:31.100 --> 21:34.630
No, it's not a teamwork thing.

21:34.630 --> 21:37.010
Yeah, we were at each other's throats.

21:37.010 --> 21:39.280
We aren't friends at all.

21:39.280 --> 21:41.270
Aw, c'mon.

21:41.660 --> 21:44.590
Anyway, what were you up to, Hanna-san?

21:44.590 --> 21:47.310
I heard you were off somewhere with Yuki-kun.

21:47.310 --> 21:49.640
Oh, um, well...

21:49.640 --> 21:51.100
I...

21:51.100 --> 21:54.330
I was, um...

21:54.330 --> 21:58.000
I went to bring Mizuha back.

22:01.360 --> 22:04.810
We couldn't bring her back.

22:05.880 --> 22:10.090
Now, everyone, eat well.

22:22.240 --> 22:23.750
Come with me.

22:37.700 --> 22:41.420
Mizuha-senpai! We were waiting for you!

22:41.420 --> 22:42.510
Welcome back!

22:42.510 --> 22:43.630
Welcome home.

22:43.630 --> 22:44.590
Thanks.

22:47.700 --> 22:50.240
You did well.

24:29.980 --> 24:55.010
<b>Preview</b>

24:32.020 --> 24:37.040
<i>In an effort to live alongside the Nokkers,</i>

24:37.520 --> 24:41.990
<i>Yuki engages in talks with a certain person.</i>

24:43.130 --> 24:49.330
<i>At a loss for direction, Fushi 
grows increasingly frustrated.</i>

24:49.330 --> 24:52.650
<i>Will he accept yet another power?</i>

24:52.010 --> 24:55.010
Coexist
